# Contracted second Bianchi identity

The package root is a lightweight build target.  The proved manifold-level
identity is exposed by `Solution.lean`, while `Challenge.lean` is available as
a separate library for Comparator replay.  Both surfaces are self-contained;
the project has no local path dependency. Its committed local curvature
dependency closure is documented in VENDORED-SOURCES.md.
